<p>Returns the nearest creature from a specific group
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> UT_GetNearestCreatureByTag(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oObject,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nGroup,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> bIncludeSelf&#160;= FALSE<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObject<dd>the object that we try to find a nearest creature from<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nGroup<dd>the group of the creature we are looking for<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bIncludeSelf<dd>Whether to include oObject in the candidate objects to return
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>the nearest creature to oObject with the specified group
